& [PreservedObservation] jsonschema 0.49.2 ValidationOptions always owns a retriever interface
  + default-features false disables the default HTTP and file resolution capabilities
  + disabling those features does not erase the Retrieve interface or the DefaultRetriever value
  + therefore an absence-of-interface claim is false and cannot govern I03A

& [CorrectedNoResolutionBoundary] has four non-substitutable layers
  + feature graph excludes resolve-http resolve-file TLS transport and equivalent external resolution capability
  + a structural preflight accepts only local fragment references that remain inside the single admitted in-memory document
  + a zero-capability deny retriever is installed explicitly as defense in depth
  + any invocation of the deny retriever is an internal-fault observation because preflight should have refused the reference first

& [ProbeDenyRetriever] is test-local dependency-admission evidence
  + the focused I03A integration test defines a zero-sized ProbeDenyRetriever implementing jsonschema referencing Retrieve
  + every retrieval request returns one deterministic denial class
  + it performs zero filesystem network registry environment provider model subprocess persistence notification or device interaction
  + it has zero cache registry fallback mutable state and caller-supplied callback
  + it proves the public construction path can replace DefaultRetriever without adding production code

& [ProductionOwnership] remains outside I03A
  + I03D owns a later production CantorDenyRetriever in the reader-observation implementation slice
  + I03A does not add reader_observation.rs or any public validator behavior
  + similarity of the two deny behaviors does not transfer implementation authority between slices

& [ReferencePreflight] examines every resolved reference-bearing keyword before validator construction
  + the root dialect URI is configuration identity and not a retrievable schema reference
  + an admitted resolved reference begins with number-sign and resolves only within the same parsed document
  + empty fragments invalid JSON Pointer syntax escaping dynamic targets relative identifiers drive-letter UNC file HTTP HTTPS and unknown schemes refuse deterministically
  + preflight is primary policy; the deny retriever is defense in depth rather than policy discovery

& [ConstructionConfiguration] is explicit
  + select Draft 2020-12
  + call should_validate_formats false
  + call should_ignore_unknown_formats true
  + register zero custom formats
  + install ProbeDenyRetriever
  + construct only after byte identity UTF-8 JSON shape and reference preflight observations pass

& [MetaSchemaObservation] remains logically distinct from instance validation
  + the report records schema well-formedness or compilation disposition separately from bounded instance disposition
  + jsonschema public builder construction may repeat schema validation internally
  + without_schema_validation is crate-private and cannot be used to manufacture operational independence
  + no requirement may claim two disjoint engine passes when the supported public API does not provide them

& [FeatureAndLockBoundary] remains exact
  + workspace jsonschema requirement is exactly 0.49.2 with default-features false
  + final lock must prove exact admitted family identities sources checksums and selected features
  + current Cargo.lock contains no jsonschema package and grants no activation
  + a future dependency or feature drift requires renewed review

& [SourceTouchBoundary] remains dependency-probe only
  + root Cargo.toml
  + Cargo.lock
  + crates/cantor_procedure_tool/Cargo.toml
  + crates/cantor_procedure_tool/tests/schema_validator_dependency.rs
  + the test-local ProbeDenyRetriever resides only in that focused integration test
  - never: production reader module library API CLI MCP service persistence provider model network effect hardware or FPGA source

& [RevisionEffect] supersedes the semantic claims of the inactive original candidate where they conflict
  + the original source package and candidate remain immutable historical evidence
  + Revision 1 remains inactive and unsigned
  + no dependency resolution compilation executable launch or test is authorized by preservation

& [RequestedDisposition] is preserve_then_sjs_then_form_inactive_revision_candidate
